quest Type:<strong> [@request_types]<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p>Project Title: <strong>[@pipol_title]<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p>PIPOL Code: <strong>[@pipol_code]<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>Best regards,<\\\\\\/p><p>ICC Secretariat<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":1,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-09-16T07:41:32.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"firstname\\\":\\\"Rolando\\\",\\\"lastname\\\":\\\"Jarabata\\\",\\\"middlename\\\":\\\"Gerodiaz\\\",\\\"avatar_url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/assets\\\\\\/img\\\\\\/default-avatar.jpg\\\",\\\"full_name\\\":\\\"Rolando G. Jarabata\\\"}}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/20\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":12,\"name\":\"Submitted Proposal Notification [IA]\",\"type\":\"html\",\"title\":\"ICC PORTAL ACKNOWLEDGMENT RECEIPT OF IMPLEMENTING AGENCY PROGRAM\\/PROJECT SUBMISSION\",\"category\":\"Email Notification\",\"description\":\"Email notification to IA upon submission of the proposal\",\"value\":\"&lt;p&gt;Dear &lt;strong&gt;[@head_designation]&lt;\\/strong&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;[@head_name]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is to acknowledge receipt of the submission by the &lt;strong&gt;[@agency_name]&lt;\\/strong&gt; of the &lt;strong&gt;[@project_title]&lt;\\/strong&gt; through the ICC Portal.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As provided under the &lt;strong&gt;Guidelines and Procedures on the Review and Approval of New and Ongoing Programs and Projects Requiring Economy and Development (ED) Council\\/Investment Coordination Committee (ICC) Action&lt;\\/strong&gt;, the submission will undergo completeness check of the submission based on the applicable ICC Checklist.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the submission is &lt;strong&gt;found incomplete or non-compliant&lt;\\/strong&gt;, the ICC Core Secretariat &lt;strong&gt;will return the submission to the implementing agency with guidance on the additional documents or information required to ensure compliance with ICC requirements&lt;\\/strong&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For any questions or requests for clarification, you may coordinate with the ICC Secretariat through the email address: &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph&lt;\\/a&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICC Core Secretariat&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEPDEv Public Investment Staff&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;NOTES:&lt;\\/u&gt;&lt;\\/em&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Submission after office hours (beyond 7:00 PM) will be reviewed on the next working day.&lt;\\/em&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**This is an auto-generated email from the ICC Portal of the Department of Economy, Planning and Development. Do not reply to this ema&lt;\\/em&gt;il.&lt;\\/p&gt;\",\"with_duration\":\"N\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"updated_by\":71,\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-10 17:11:13\",\"editor\":null,\"actions\":\"<div class=\\\"btn-group\\\" role=\\\"group\\\"><button data-bs-toggle=\\\"tooltip\\\" data-bs-original-title=\\\"Edit\\\" class=\\\"border-0 bg-transparent\\\" onclick=\'showParameter({\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Submitted Proposal Notification [IA]\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"html\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"ICC PORTAL ACKNOWLEDGMENT RECEIPT OF IMPLEMENTING AGENCY PROGRAM\\\\\\/PROJECT SUBMISSION\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Email Notification\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Email notification to IA upon submission of the proposal\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"<p>Dear <strong>[@head_designation]<\\\\\\/strong>  <strong>[@head_name]<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>This is to acknowledge receipt of the submission by the <strong>[@agency_name]<\\\\\\/strong> of the <strong>[@project_title]<\\\\\\/strong> through the ICC Portal.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>As provided under the <strong>Guidelines and Procedures on the Review and Approval of New and Ongoing Programs and Projects Requiring Economy and Development (ED) Council\\\\\\/Investment Coordination Committee (ICC) Action<\\\\\\/strong>, the submission will undergo completeness check of the submission based on the applicable ICC Checklist.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>If the submission is <strong>found incomplete or non-compliant<\\\\\\/strong>, the ICC Core Secretariat <strong>will return the submission to the implementing agency with guidance on the additional documents or information required to ensure compliance with ICC requirements<\\\\\\/strong>.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>For any questions or requests for clarification, you may coordinate with the ICC Secretariat through the email address: <a href=\\\\\\\"mailto:ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph\\\\\\\" rel=\\\\\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph<\\\\\\/a>.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>Thank you.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><strong>ICC Core Secretariat<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><strong>DEPDEv Public Investment Staff<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><strong><em><u>NOTES:<\\\\\\/u><\\\\\\/em><\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><em>*Submission after office hours (beyond 7:00 PM) will be reviewed on the next working day.<\\\\\\/em><\\\\\\/p><p><em>**This is an auto-generated email from the ICC Portal of the Department of Economy, Planning and Development. Do not reply to this ema<\\\\\\/em>il.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":71,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-12-10T09:11:13.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":null}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/12\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Submission Prompt\",\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Submit ICC Proposal?\",\"category\":\"Prompt (Error,Warning,Info)\",\"description\":\"Prompt before submitting proposal\",\"value\":\"Once submitted, you will not be able to edit your submission, and it will proceed to validation. Submissions received before the cutoff time will be reviewed and evaluated on the next business day.\",\"with_duration\":\"N\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"updated_by\":37,\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-16 15:40:44\",\"editor\":null,\"actions\":\"<div class=\\\"btn-group\\\" role=\\\"group\\\"><button data-bs-toggle=\\\"tooltip\\\" data-bs-original-title=\\\"Edit\\\" class=\\\"border-0 bg-transparent\\\" onclick=\'showParameter({\\\"id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Submission Prompt\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Submit ICC Proposal?\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Prompt (Error,Warning,Info)\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Prompt before submitting proposal\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Once submitted, you will not be able to edit your submission, and it will proceed to validation. Submissions received before the cutoff time will be reviewed and evaluated on the next business day.\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":37,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-09-16T07:40:44.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":null}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/5\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":15,\"name\":\"Returned to Agency Proposal Notification\",\"type\":\"html\",\"title\":\"ICC PORTAL NOTICE OF INCOMPLETE PROGRAM\\/PROJECT SUBMISSION\",\"category\":\"Email Notification\",\"description\":\"Email notification upon return of the proposal\",\"value\":\"&lt;p&gt;Dear &lt;strong&gt;[@head_designation]&lt;\\/strong&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;[@head_name]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following the initial review of the submission for the &lt;strong&gt;[@project_title]&lt;\\/strong&gt; based on the List of ICC Requisite Documents for &lt;strong&gt;[@request_types]&lt;\\/strong&gt;, the submission is found to be &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;INCOMPLETE&lt;\\/u&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pursuant to Section V.2 of the &lt;strong&gt;Guidelines and Procedures on the Review and Approval of New and Ongoing Programs and Projects Requiring Economy and Development (ED) Council\\/Investment Coordination Committee (ICC) Action&lt;\\/strong&gt;, the &lt;strong&gt;[@project_title]&lt;\\/strong&gt; is being returned to the implementing agency. The implementing agency may refer to the ICC Checklist for &lt;strong&gt;[@request_types]&lt;\\/strong&gt; attached to this email, which reflects remarks on the results of the completeness check.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For any questions or requests for clarification, you may coordinate with the ICC Secretariat through the email address: &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph&lt;\\/a&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICC Core Secretariat&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEPDEv Public Investment Staff&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;NOTES:&lt;\\/u&gt;&lt;\\/em&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**This is an auto-generated email from the ICC Portal of the Department of Economy, Planning and Development. Do not reply to this ema&lt;\\/em&gt;il.&lt;\\/p&gt;\",\"with_duration\":\"N\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"updated_by\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-25 15:17:49\",\"editor\":\"Rolando G. Jarabata\",\"actions\":\"<div class=\\\"btn-group\\\" role=\\\"group\\\"><button data-bs-toggle=\\\"tooltip\\\" data-bs-original-title=\\\"Edit\\\" class=\\\"border-0 bg-transparent\\\" onclick=\'showParameter({\\\"id\\\":15,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Returned to Agency Proposal Notification\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"html\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"ICC PORTAL NOTICE OF INCOMPLETE PROGRAM\\\\\\/PROJECT SUBMISSION\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Email Notification\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Email notification upon return of the proposal\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"<p>Dear <strong>[@head_designation]<\\\\\\/strong>  <strong>[@head_name]<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>Following the initial review of the submission for the <strong>[@project_title]<\\\\\\/strong> based on the List of ICC Requisite Documents for <strong>[@request_types]<\\\\\\/strong>, the submission is found to be <strong><u>INCOMPLETE<\\\\\\/u><\\\\\\/strong>.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>Pursuant to Section V.2 of the <strong>Guidelines and Procedures on the Review and Approval of New and Ongoing Programs and Projects Requiring Economy and Development (ED) Council\\\\\\/Investment Coordination Committee (ICC) Action<\\\\\\/strong>, the <strong>[@project_title]<\\\\\\/strong> is being returned to the implementing agency. The implementing agency may refer to the ICC Checklist for <strong>[@request_types]<\\\\\\/strong> attached to this email, which reflects remarks on the results of the completeness check.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>For any questions or requests for clarification, you may coordinate with the ICC Secretariat through the email address: <a href=\\\\\\\"mailto:ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph\\\\\\\" rel=\\\\\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph<\\\\\\/a>.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>Thank you.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><strong>ICC Core Secretariat<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><strong>DEPDEv Public Investment Staff<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><strong><em><u>NOTES:<\\\\\\/u><\\\\\\/em><\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><em>**This is an auto-generated email from the ICC Portal of the Department of Economy, Planning and Development. Do not reply to this ema<\\\\\\/em>il.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":1,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-11-25T07:17:49.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"firstname\\\":\\\"Rolando\\\",\\\"lastname\\\":\\\"Jarabata\\\",\\\"middlename\\\":\\\"Gerodiaz\\\",\\\"avatar_url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/assets\\\\\\/img\\\\\\/default-avatar.jpg\\\",\\\"full_name\\\":\\\"Rolando G. Jarabata\\\"}}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/15\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":11,\"name\":\"Return(Compliance) Prompt\",\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Return ICC proposal to agency?\",\"category\":\"Prompt (Error,Warning,Info)\",\"description\":\"Prompt before rejecting for compliance review\",\"value\":\"Once returned, this submission cannot be edited until the agency resubmits the proposal\",\"with_duration\":\"N\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"updated_by\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-16 15:40:44\",\"editor\":\"Rolando G. Jarabata\",\"actions\":\"<div class=\\\"btn-group\\\" role=\\\"group\\\"><button data-bs-toggle=\\\"tooltip\\\" data-bs-original-title=\\\"Edit\\\" class=\\\"border-0 bg-transparent\\\" onclick=\'showParameter({\\\"id\\\":11,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Return(Compliance) Prompt\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Return ICC proposal to agency?\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Prompt (Error,Warning,Info)\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Prompt before rejecting for compliance review\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Once returned, this submission cannot be edited until the agency resubmits the proposal\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":1,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-09-16T07:40:44.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"firstname\\\":\\\"Rolando\\\",\\\"lastname\\\":\\\"Jarabata\\\",\\\"middlename\\\":\\\"Gerodiaz\\\",\\\"avatar_url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/assets\\\\\\/img\\\\\\/default-avatar.jpg\\\",\\\"full_name\\\":\\\"Rolando G. Jarabata\\\"}}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/11\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Return(Completeness) Prompt\",\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Return ICC proposal to agency?\",\"category\":\"Prompt (Error,Warning,Info)\",\"description\":\"Prompt before returning for completeness review\",\"value\":\"Once returned, this submission cannot be edited until the agency resubmits the proposal\",\"with_duration\":\"N\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"updated_by\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-16 15:40:44\",\"editor\":\"Rolando G. Jarabata\",\"actions\":\"<div class=\\\"btn-group\\\" role=\\\"group\\\"><button data-bs-toggle=\\\"tooltip\\\" data-bs-original-title=\\\"Edit\\\" class=\\\"border-0 bg-transparent\\\" onclick=\'showParameter({\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Return(Completeness) Prompt\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Return ICC proposal to agency?\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Prompt (Error,Warning,Info)\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Prompt before returning for completeness review\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Once returned, this submission cannot be edited until the agency resubmits the proposal\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":1,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-09-16T07:40:44.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"firstname\\\":\\\"Rolando\\\",\\\"lastname\\\":\\\"Jarabata\\\",\\\"middlename\\\":\\\"Gerodiaz\\\",\\\"avatar_url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/assets\\\\\\/img\\\\\\/default-avatar.jpg\\\",\\\"full_name\\\":\\\"Rolando G. Jarabata\\\"}}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/10\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Resubmitted Proposal Notification\",\"type\":\"html\",\"title\":\"ICC PORTAL ACKNOWLEDGMENT RECEIPT OF IMPLEMENTING AGENCY PROGRAM\\/PROJECT RESUBMISSION\",\"category\":\"Email Notification\",\"description\":\"Email notification upon resubmission of the proposal\",\"value\":\"&lt;p&gt;Dear &lt;strong&gt;[@head_designation]&lt;\\/strong&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;[@head_name]&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is to acknowledge receipt of the resubmission by the &lt;strong&gt;[@agency_name]&lt;\\/strong&gt; of the &lt;strong&gt;[@project_title]&lt;\\/strong&gt; through the ICC Portal.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As provided under the &lt;strong&gt;Guidelines and Procedures on the Review and Approval of New and Ongoing Programs and Projects Requiring Economy and Development (ED) Council\\/Investment Coordination Committee (ICC) Action&lt;\\/strong&gt;, the resubmission will undergo completeness check of the submission based on the applicable ICC Checklist.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the resubmission is &lt;strong&gt;found incomplete or non-compliant&lt;\\/strong&gt;, the ICC Core Secretariat &lt;strong&gt;will return the submission to the implementing agency with guidance on the additional documents or information required to ensure compliance with ICC requirements&lt;\\/strong&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For any questions or requests for clarification, you may coordinate with the ICC Secretariat through the email address: &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph&lt;\\/a&gt;.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you.&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICC Core Secretariat&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEPDEv Public Investment Staff&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;NOTES:&lt;\\/u&gt;&lt;\\/em&gt;&lt;\\/strong&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Submission after office hours (beyond 7:00 PM) will be reviewed on the next working day.&lt;\\/em&gt;&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**This is an auto-generated email from the ICC Portal of the Department of Economy, Planning and Development. Do not reply to this ema&lt;\\/em&gt;il.&lt;\\/p&gt;\",\"with_duration\":\"N\",\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"updated_by\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-25 15:24:23\",\"editor\":\"Rolando G. Jarabata\",\"actions\":\"<div class=\\\"btn-group\\\" role=\\\"group\\\"><button data-bs-toggle=\\\"tooltip\\\" data-bs-original-title=\\\"Edit\\\" class=\\\"border-0 bg-transparent\\\" onclick=\'showParameter({\\\"id\\\":16,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Resubmitted Proposal Notification\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"html\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"ICC PORTAL ACKNOWLEDGMENT RECEIPT OF IMPLEMENTING AGENCY PROGRAM\\\\\\/PROJECT RESUBMISSION\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Email Notification\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Email notification upon resubmission of the proposal\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"<p>Dear <strong>[@head_designation]<\\\\\\/strong>  <strong>[@head_name]<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>This is to acknowledge receipt of the resubmission by the <strong>[@agency_name]<\\\\\\/strong> of the <strong>[@project_title]<\\\\\\/strong> through the ICC Portal.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>As provided under the <strong>Guidelines and Procedures on the Review and Approval of New and Ongoing Programs and Projects Requiring Economy and Development (ED) Council\\\\\\/Investment Coordination Committee (ICC) Action<\\\\\\/strong>, the resubmission will undergo completeness check of the submission based on the applicable ICC Checklist.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>If the resubmission is <strong>found incomplete or non-compliant<\\\\\\/strong>, the ICC Core Secretariat <strong>will return the submission to the implementing agency with guidance on the additional documents or information required to ensure compliance with ICC requirements<\\\\\\/strong>.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>For any questions or requests for clarification, you may coordinate with the ICC Secretariat through the email address: <a href=\\\\\\\"mailto:ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph\\\\\\\" rel=\\\\\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">ICCCoreSecretariat@depdev.gov.ph<\\\\\\/a>.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p>Thank you.<\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><strong>ICC Core Secretariat<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><strong>DEPDEv Public Investment Staff<\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><br><\\\\\\/p><p><strong><em><u>NOTES:<\\\\\\/u><\\\\\\/em><\\\\\\/strong><\\\\\\/p><p><em>*Submission after office hours (beyond 7:00 PM) will be reviewed on the next working day.<\\\\\\/em><\\\\\\/p><p><em>**This is an auto-generated email from the ICC Portal of the Department of Economy, Planning and Development. Do not reply to this ema<\\\\\\/em>il.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"with_duration\\\":\\\"N\\\",\\\"start_date\\\":null,\\\"end_date\\\":null,\\\"updated_by\\\":1,\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2025-11-25T07:24:23.000000Z\\\",\\\"editor\\\":{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"firstname\\\":\\\"Rolando\\\",\\\"lastname\\\":\\\"Jarabata\\\",\\\"middlename\\\":\\\"Gerodiaz\\\",\\\"avatar_url\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/assets\\\\\\/img\\\\\\/default-avatar.jpg\\\",\\\"full_name\\\":\\\"Rolando G. Jarabata\\\"}}, \\\"http:\\/\\/helpdesk.test\\/administrator\\/parameters\\/16\\\")\'><i class=\\\"fa fa-pencil text-info\\\"><\\/i><\\/button><\\/div>\"},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Rejected User Notification\",\"type\":\"html\",\"title\":\"[Rejected] ICC Portal Account\",\"category\":\"Email Notification\",\"description\":\"Email notification containing the reason for rejection\",\"value\":\"&lt;p&gt;Dear 